{"2379350": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Scramble Knights Online", "steam_appid": 2379350, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Press &quot;</strong><strong><u>Request Access</u></strong><strong>&quot; for instant access to the Open Beta!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2379350/extras/ad549093a61b927fe5c0f71f14935e5e.avif?t=1787317440\" width=1500 height=68 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2379350/extras/ea276eccaf4b66d093c35ac129912827.poster.avif?t=1787317440\" width=1170 height=546 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2379350/extras/ea276eccaf4b66d093c35ac129912827.webm?t=1787317440\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2379350/extras/ea276eccaf4b66d093c35ac129912827.mp4?t=1787317440\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Scramble Knights Online, an MMO-lite adventure! Embark together with friends on bite-sized, Zelda-inspired quests in the shared online kingdom of Terracott! Venture across an archipelago filled with dangerous enemies, quaint towns, puzzling dungeons, and challenges suited for a knight-in-training. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2379350/extras/bb51c3d0748e9c2b00226cdf4e0a413c.poster.avif?t=1787317440\" width=1170 height=546 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2379350/extras/bb51c3d0748e9c2b00226cdf4e0a413c.webm?t=1787317440\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2379350/extras/bb51c3d0748e9c2b00226cdf4e0a413c.mp4?t=1787317440\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quests will have you face off against electric slimes, rock-hurling crabs, towering dungeon bosses, and other dangerous creatures in strategic top-down combat. Meet other players on their own adventure and team up against powerful foes, race for valuable treasure, or even clash in PvP invasions. <br>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2379350/extras/9f2d4f200a0cdead9525f435b231aa11.poster.avif?t=1787317440\" width=1170 height=546 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2379350/extras/9f2d4f200a0cdead9525f435b231aa11.webm?t=1787317440\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2379350/extras/9f2d4f200a0cdead9525f435b231aa11.mp4?t=1787317440\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After an adventure, head back to the Town Square to hang out, upgrade gear, show off your look, fish with friends, and prepare for your next expedition. Meet other online knights, squad up, and jump back into the action together! <strong>There’s nothing like clucking around with friends.</strong><br></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2379350/extras/37bf35fbd0d3d3f3b060c1866df51c52.poster.avif?t=1787317440\" width=1170 height=546 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2379350/extras/37bf35fbd0d3d3f3b060c1866df51c52.webm?t=1787317440\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2379350/extras/37bf35fbd0d3d3f3b060c1866df51c52.mp4?t=1787317440\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete quests to earn gems, crafting materials, and rare loot. Forge powerful weapons, craft sturdy armor, upgrade your equipment, and experiment with new builds that fit your personal combat style. The more you explore, the stronger your knight becomes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2379350/extras/ad549093a61b927fe5c0f71f14935e5e.avif?t=1787317440\" width=1500 height=68 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Online Co-Op Adventure:</strong> Play solo or co-op with up to 4 players in a shared online world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Action Combat:</strong> Master a variety of unique weapons and abilities to overcome enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dungeon Diving:</strong> Enter Zelda-like dungeons to solve puzzles, find secrets, and challenge bosses!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Town Square:</strong> A place to socialize, upgrade gear, fish, and party up before the next quest.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PvP:</strong> Encounter other teams of knights on their own adventures and clash over resources.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Online Split Screen:</strong> Play local couch co-op online with a friend (not available in Beta test).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chicken Mode:</strong> If you die, spectate your team as a chicken. Cluck. Cluck.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2379350/extras/37efd838bca4635d75df502dcaeb5d17.poster.avif?t=1787317440\" width=144 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2379350/extras/37efd838bca4635d75df502dcaeb5d17.webm?t=1787317440\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>       </p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Press &quot;</strong><strong><u>Request Access</u></strong><strong>&quot; for instant access to the Open Beta!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2379350/extras/ad549093a61b927fe5c0f71f14935e5e.avif?t=1787317440\" width=1500 height=68 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2379350/extras/ea276eccaf4b66d093c35ac129912827.poster.avif?t=1787317440\" width=1170 height=546 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2379350/extras/ea276eccaf4b66d093c35ac129912827.webm?t=1787317440\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2379350/extras/ea276eccaf4b66d093c35ac129912827.mp4?t=1787317440\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Scramble Knights Online, an MMO-lite adventure! Embark together with friends on bite-sized, Zelda-inspired quests in the shared online kingdom of Terracott! Venture across an archipelago filled with dangerous enemies, quaint towns, puzzling dungeons, and challenges suited for a knight-in-training. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster